      "line_start": 7,
      "line_end": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "# Chapter 1: The Gathering\nThe Council of Elders met in the Obsidian Chamber.\nElder Thorne, the keeper of the Chronos Blade, spoke first.\n\"The shadow is rising,\" he warned.",
      "hash": "sha256:ed4191eeb078d28efd4041dcfafba1d1606415963fd9e4b059d721e90fe21373",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "# Chapter 2: The Quest\nLyra left the city of Aethelgard.\nShe carried the map to the Sunken Ruins.\nThe ruins were located in the Whispering Woods.",
      "hash": "sha256:f1b903e001d9b3465a6ef2d0d1872d38f82da00939d7615acf0368433d627a29",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "# Chapter 3: The Encounter\nA rogue automaton blocked her path.\n\"Identify yourself,\" the machine demanded.\nLyra activated her Shield Generator.",
      "hash": "sha256:c9057c8b7decadd359dc50439627cad276ebeb889bb81814fc3b1466c1633b66",
      "line_start": 19,
      "line_end": 22
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "# Chapter 4: The Revelation\nWithin the ruins, she found the Ancient Data Core.\nIt contained the lost history of the Faction of Light.",
      "hash": "sha256:d6f2b8e432075841ac7164986d6a5ac18ff6f58d5a90c5a90dcaccd7e0cd2760",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 26
    }
  ],
